      "writtenOn": "2020-12-16T12:04:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "VNDK installs only one file and shares that file for both vendor and product modules on runtime. We may not define different versions of a VNDK lib for each partition.\nLet me update the details to the comment.",
