      "writtenOn": "2020-12-16T12:04:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree that this is fragile.\n\nAll the alternative solutions works for the VNDK purpose. But I didn\u0027t want to make a special rule for defining product variant for the VNDKs. As the other product_available modules, the product variant of VNDK uses target.product instead of target.vendor.\n\nLet me find a better solution for this as you suggested.",
